# An in-game LOAD (pause menu SAVE/LOAD screen): re-apply the store after the save's own
# options were restored (apply_to_loaded_saves).
movie SCRSAVELOAD
prepend-to function LoadComplete in ScrSaveLoad file=saveload_loadcomplete_head.aptasm
